        "title": "Kajan Zion tumei ram gaitei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kajan Zion tumei ram gai4@&,",
            "Ninga phang e tingmik kathui;",
            "Khou 4@& lung khang jai lou o,",
            "Nban thai pui ram khou.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He ai ninge kanloumeipu,",
            "Lili puang Guang Immanuel;",
            "Nthanmei dui 4@& luange,",
            "Ai rui hei 4@& ning thuk ge.",
            "",
            "2. Pap le nthiampui rih rui dai e,",
            "Pinge pap rihta adou khang;",
            "He kauh bumang sam kei o,",
            "Aniu ta kanlou khang.",
            "",
            "3. Lung geimei rui banthai khang makge,",
            "Hei kandih rianra ram khou hei;",
            "Npat louna tat ni e,",
            "Kauh kanaan ram gai thang.",
            "",
            "4. Kalvari siangding kross rukhou 4@&,",
            "Khang lou the aniu Guang Jisu;",
            "Ai rui hei 4@& mu lak khe,",
            "Hallelujah Amen."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
